              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wide">BUSINESS DEVELOPER</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-2">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">"Nomad Magazine is like having that well-traveled, fascinating friend who always knows the best places to go, how to settle in, and how to avoid common expat headaches."</p>
